AU05 vendor key routing verification — 2026-09-21

User-operated A/B observations:
- Heartbeat on, standard Fn input interface open: Enter and Fn do not work; no standard input callbacks.
- Heartbeat on, standard Fn input interface closed: Enter still does not work; vendor events arrive.
- Heartbeat off, vendor interface and online queries remain open: Enter works again.

Six-control capture order: top, middle, bottom, knob press, clockwise tick, counterclockwise tick.
Only the first eight decrypted key-event bytes are recorded; no device identifiers.
frame[2] = logical action; frame[3] = down/up; frame[4] = AU05 physical control index.
The four push controls emit down/up. Rotation emits down only and requires a host-generated release.

